 "words": 246,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Set apart to God before he ever saw the light",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "No razor on his head and the Spirit gave him might",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the vineyards of Timnah a young lion roared and ran",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And he tore the lion apart with his bare hands",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Down in the Valley of Sorek Delilah held him near",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The rulers of the Philistines put silver in her ear",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Tell me, where does your great strength come from",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Night after night she pressed him till he told her everything in his heart",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "She lulled him to sleep on her lap",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Seven braids fell to the floor",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Samson, the Philistines are upon you",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But he did not know that the LORD had left him",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They took his eyes and chained him, grinding grain in Gaza's jail",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But the hair of his head began to grow back",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.08,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They brought him out to Dagon's house to laugh at what he'd lost",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Three thousand on the rooftop, and he stood between the posts",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Sovereign LORD, remember me",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Please, God, strengthen me just once more",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Blind and bound in the house of Dagon",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.7,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Hands upon the pillars, I am crying out to you",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 3.27,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He pushed with all his might",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 41.06,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And the temple came down",
   "heard": 5,
